- [Federal Tax Modeling & Microsimulation](https://taxfoundation.org/topics/economic-and-tax-modeling/): Overview of the Tax Foundation's macroeconomic and distributional modeling methodology

## Federal Tax Research
- [Federal Tax Research Hub](https://taxfoundation.org/research/federal-tax/): Index of all federal tax research, reports, and analysis
- [Individual Income Tax](https://taxfoundation.org/topics/individual-income-taxes/): Research on marginal rates, brackets, deductions, credits, and reform options
- [Corporate Income Tax](https://taxfoundation.org/topics/corporate-income-taxes/): Analysis of the corporate rate, global minimum tax, and business tax reform
- [Tariffs & Trade](https://taxfoundation.org/topics/tariffs-and-trade/): Policy analysis of tariffs as a tax instrument, trade deficits, and economic effects
- [Cost Recovery & Expensing](https://taxfoundation.org/topics/cost-recovery/): Research on bonus depreciation, full expensing (100% expensing), and capital investment incentives
- [Taxes on Savers & Investors](https://taxfoundation.org/tags/taxing-savers-and-investors/): Analysis of capital gains taxes, dividend taxes, and investment tax policy
- [Debt & Deficits](https://taxfoundation.org/tags/debt-and-interest-rates): Research connecting tax policy choices to federal debt, deficits, and interest costs
- [Excise Taxes](https://taxfoundation.org/topics/excise-taxes/): Coverage of sin taxes, carbon taxes, and other excise levies at the federal level
- [Tax Cuts and Jobs Act (TCJA)](https://taxfoundation.org/tags/tax-cuts-and-jobs-act/): Archive of all research related to the 2017 TCJA and its 2025 expiration/extension

